project Collatz
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1

entry console main

error MainError
errorCase MainError ConsoleWriteFailed Int32

operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main read clock.cpu
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
memory main stack max 8KiB
async main no

purpose operation main "Sum the Collatz stopping times for every start value in 1..collatzStartUpperLimit and report checksum plus elapsed seconds"
invariant operation main "The inner loop applies the Collatz map until currentCollatzValue reaches one, so it always terminates for positive starts"
invariant operation main "Elapsed seconds equals elapsed CPU-clock ticks divided by the Windows CLOCKS_PER_SEC of 1000"

label startMain

storage module immutable collatzStartUpperLimit Int64 1000000
storage module immutable collatzStartLowerLimit Int64 1
storage module immutable loopStepIncrement Int64 1
storage module immutable collatzTerminationValue Int64 1
storage module immutable evenParityRemainder Int64 0
storage module immutable parityDivisor Int64 2
storage module immutable collatzOddMultiplier Int64 3
storage module immutable collatzOddAddend Int64 1
storage module immutable stepCounterInitial Int64 0
storage module immutable totalStepsInitial Int64 0
storage module immutable windowsClocksPerSecond Float64 1000.0

memory main mutable currentStartValue Int64 collatzStartLowerLimit
memory main mutable totalCollatzSteps Int64 totalStepsInitial
memory main mutable currentCollatzValue Int64 collatzStartLowerLimit
memory main mutable currentCollatzSteps Int64 stepCounterInitial

call benchmarkStartClockCall c.clock
run benchmarkStartClockCall
bind value benchmarkStartClockTicks CpuClockTicks benchmarkStartClockCall

label outerLoopHead

call outerShouldContinueCall math.lessThanOrEqualInt64
argument outerShouldContinueCall left Int64 currentStartValue
argument outerShouldContinueCall right Int64 collatzStartUpperLimit
run outerShouldContinueCall
bind value outerShouldContinue Bool outerShouldContinueCall
branch if condition outerShouldContinue target outerLoopBody
branch else target outerLoopFinished

label outerLoopBody
set memory currentCollatzValue currentStartValue
set memory currentCollatzSteps stepCounterInitial
jump target innerLoopHead

label innerLoopHead
call innerShouldContinueCall math.notEqualInt64
argument innerShouldContinueCall left Int64 currentCollatzValue
argument innerShouldContinueCall right Int64 collatzTerminationValue
run innerShouldContinueCall
bind value innerShouldContinue Bool innerShouldContinueCall
branch if condition innerShouldContinue target innerLoopBody
branch else target innerLoopFinished

label innerLoopBody
call collatzParityCall math.moduloInt64
argument collatzParityCall left Int64 currentCollatzValue
argument collatzParityCall right Int64 parityDivisor
run collatzParityCall
bind value collatzParityRemainder Int64 collatzParityCall

call collatzValueIsEvenCall math.equalInt64
argument collatzValueIsEvenCall left Int64 collatzParityRemainder
argument collatzValueIsEvenCall right Int64 evenParityRemainder
run collatzValueIsEvenCall
bind value collatzValueIsEven Bool collatzValueIsEvenCall
branch if condition collatzValueIsEven target collatzEvenStep
branch else target collatzOddStep

label collatzEvenStep
call collatzHalveCall math.divideInt64
argument collatzHalveCall left Int64 currentCollatzValue
argument collatzHalveCall right Int64 parityDivisor
run collatzHalveCall
bind value collatzHalvedValue Int64 collatzHalveCall
set memory currentCollatzValue collatzHalvedValue
jump target collatzStepCounted

label collatzOddStep
call collatzTripleCall math.multiplyInt64
argument collatzTripleCall left Int64 currentCollatzValue
argument collatzTripleCall right Int64 collatzOddMultiplier
run collatzTripleCall
bind value collatzTripledValue Int64 collatzTripleCall
call collatzOddNextCall math.addInt64
argument collatzOddNextCall left Int64 collatzTripledValue
argument collatzOddNextCall right Int64 collatzOddAddend
run collatzOddNextCall
bind value collatzOddNextValue Int64 collatzOddNextCall
set memory currentCollatzValue collatzOddNextValue
jump target collatzStepCounted

label collatzStepCounted
call incrementCollatzStepsCall math.addInt64
argument incrementCollatzStepsCall left Int64 currentCollatzSteps
argument incrementCollatzStepsCall right Int64 loopStepIncrement
run incrementCollatzStepsCall
bind value nextCollatzSteps Int64 incrementCollatzStepsCall
set memory currentCollatzSteps nextCollatzSteps
jump target innerLoopHead

label innerLoopFinished
call accumulateTotalStepsCall math.addInt64
argument accumulateTotalStepsCall left Int64 totalCollatzSteps
argument accumulateTotalStepsCall right Int64 currentCollatzSteps
run accumulateTotalStepsCall
bind value nextTotalCollatzSteps Int64 accumulateTotalStepsCall
set memory totalCollatzSteps nextTotalCollatzSteps

call advanceStartValueCall math.addInt64
argument advanceStartValueCall left Int64 currentStartValue
argument advanceStartValueCall right Int64 loopStepIncrement
run advanceStartValueCall
bind value nextStartValue Int64 advanceStartValueCall
set memory currentStartValue nextStartValue
jump target outerLoopHead

label outerLoopFinished

call benchmarkEndClockCall c.clock
run benchmarkEndClockCall
bind value benchmarkEndClockTicks CpuClockTicks benchmarkEndClockCall

call elapsedClockTicksCall math.subtractInt64
argument elapsedClockTicksCall left CpuClockTicks benchmarkEndClockTicks
argument elapsedClockTicksCall right CpuClockTicks benchmarkStartClockTicks
run elapsedClockTicksCall
bind value elapsedClockTicks Int64 elapsedClockTicksCall

call elapsedClockTicksAsFloatCall math.convertInt64ToFloat64
argument elapsedClockTicksAsFloatCall value Int64 elapsedClockTicks
run elapsedClockTicksAsFloatCall
bind value elapsedClockTicksAsFloat Float64 elapsedClockTicksAsFloatCall

call elapsedSecondsCall math.divideFloat64
argument elapsedSecondsCall left Float64 elapsedClockTicksAsFloat
argument elapsedSecondsCall right Float64 windowsClocksPerSecond
run elapsedSecondsCall
bind value elapsedSeconds Float64 elapsedSecondsCall

storage module immutable reportFormatText String "checksum=%lld elapsedSeconds=%.6f\n"
call reportCall c.printf
argument reportCall format String reportFormatText
argument reportCall checksum Int64 totalCollatzSteps
argument reportCall elapsedSeconds Float64 elapsedSeconds
run reportCall
ignore void source reportCall
bind error reportError Int32 reportCall
branch error source reportCall target consoleWriteFailed

storage module immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
return ok successfulExitCode

label consoleWriteFailed
makeError consoleWriteFailure MainError.ConsoleWriteFailed reportError
return error consoleWriteFailure
